# Generated knowledge-base + memory stores (JSON) — the sample .md stays tracked
apps/api/knowledge/*.json
# …but the curated ingest manifest IS tracked
!apps/api/knowledge/manifest.json
# …and the embedding-free deploy copy of the card store IS tracked (small; production keyword retrieval)
!apps/api/knowledge/cards-lite.json
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Documentation kept local (not published) ─────────────────
# Only README.md is tracked; all other markdown docs stay out of the repo.
# docs/ additionally holds the KNOWLEDGE CORPUS (Varsity modules + book
# markdown/PDFs) — copyrighted source material that must NEVER be pushed.
# Production gets the distilled cards via apps/api/knowledge/cards-lite.json.
# Screenshots under docs/screenshots/ are intentionally kept (README uses them).
/PROJECT_EXPLAINED.md
/FUTURE_CHANGES.md
/TERMINALCHAT.md
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/DATAFLOW.md
docs/*
!docs/screenshots
